  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole animal with a deep trunk and exceptionally substantial long tail base, retaining original inventory gate rather than a renamed slender ornithopod.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Artistic composite informed by Manchester April mounted skeleton, Carbon County Museum of the Rockies partial fossil and OMNH58340 skull. These are separate individuals, not a single complete specimen. Seven metres is a genus-level estimate, not measurement of these specimens. Soft tissue thickness, skin, colour and pose are inferred. Do not copy collapsed burial curvature or the old upright mount posture.\",\"zh\":\"综合曼彻斯特April装架、落基山博物馆Carbon County部分化石与OMNH58340头骨的完整活体美术复原；是不同个体而非同一完整标本。7米为属级估值，不是上述个体实测。肌肉厚度、皮肤、颜色和姿态为推断；不复制埋藏弯折或旧直立装架姿态。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":369,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Tenontosaurus\",\"zh\":\"腱龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Tenontosaurus tilletti\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Ornithischia, Ornithopoda\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":7.0,\"basis\":\"NHM genus profile approximate length; not specimen measurement.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Deep ribcage and thick muscular pelvic/tail-base volume; not thin scaled Dryosaurus or Mantellisaurus.\",\"Very long deep proximal tail, smoothly tapering; substantial depth persists behind pelvis before gradual taper.\",\"Small low elongated beaked head without crest/horns, short forelimbs and strong hindlimbs.\",\"Complete four limbs, intact tail and head; neutral near-horizontal quadrupedal stance.\",\"No claim the muscle volume or locomotor habit is directly fossilized.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"Actually inspected Manchester April mount (tail cropped), MOR partial skeleton in slab and Thomas2015Fig2 OMNH58340 skull; combined observations, not conflated identifiers.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole animal with a deep trunk and exceptionally substantial long tail base, retaining original inventory gate rather than a renamed slender ornithopod.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Artistic composite informed by Manchester April mounted skeleton, Carbon County Museum of the Rockies partial fossil and OMNH58340 skull. These are separate individuals, not a single complete specimen. Seven metres is a genus-level estimate, not measurement of these specimens. Soft tissue thickness, skin, colour and pose are inferred. Do not copy collapsed burial curvature or the old upright mount posture.\",\"zh\":\"综合曼彻斯特April装架、落基山博物馆Carbon County部分化石与OMNH58340头骨的完整活体美术复原；是不同个体而非同一完整标本。7米为属级估值，不是上述个体实测。肌肉厚度、皮肤、颜色和姿态为推断；不复制埋藏弯折或旧直立装架姿态。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":369,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Tenontosaurus\",\"zh\":\"腱龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Tenontosaurus tilletti\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Ornithischia, Ornithopoda\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":7.0,\"basis\":\"NHM genus profile approximate length; not specimen measurement.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Deep ribcage and thick muscular pelvic/tail-base volume; not thin scaled Dryosaurus or Mantellisaurus.\",\"Very long deep proximal tail, smoothly tapering; substantial depth persists behind pelvis before gradual taper.\",\"Small low elongated beaked head without crest/horns, short forelimbs and strong hindlimbs.\",\"Complete four limbs, intact tail and head; neutral near-horizontal quadrupedal stance.\",\"No claim the muscle volume or locomotor habit is directly fossilized.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"Actually inspected Manchester April mount (tail cropped), MOR partial skeleton in slab and Thomas2015Fig2 OMNH58340 skull; combined observations, not conflated identifiers.\"}"
  },
